            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.54

- Check for signed updates from **Weft → Check for Updates…**.
- Enable background update checks in Settings. Weft asks before installation.
- Keep agent connections scoped to the active account and workspace.

Requires macOS 26 or later and Apple silicon. Builds through 1.0.52 need one manual installation of this version to enable in-app updates.
]]></description>
